xpose?\n\nAIMarket — live agent marketplace exposes 13 tools: market_search, market_invoke, pipeline_prepare, pipeline_invoke, pipeline_status, and 8 more. Their descriptions and schemas cost roughly 1,797 tokens of context every time the server is loaded.\n\n### Does the AIMarket — live agent marketplace MCP server require authentication?\n\nNo. We connected to AIMarket — live agent marketplace without credentials and it answered, so anything it exposes is reachable by anyone who knows the address.\n\n### Is the AIMarket — live agent marketplace MCP server still maintained?\n\nAIMarket — live agent marketplace is still listed as active in the MCP registry. We last reached this channel on 4 November 2026. Those dates come from our own scans of the registry and the channel itself, not from anything the publisher announced.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAIMarket MCP Gateway - Odel Module Marketplace (https://odel.app/modules/alexar76/aimarket-mcp)\nciteturn34search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; `AIMARKET_API_KEY`  | Credit-account key from the hub's `/start` page (`https://modelmarket.dev/start`): priced `market_invoke` calls are paid from its prepaid balance; while it is short the free trial still applies. ...     io.github.alexar76/aimarket-mcp\n## Configure (env)\n\nvar  | meaning\n--- | ---\n`AIMARKET_METIS_URL`  | Metis verify API base (default `https://metis.modelmarket.dev`)\n`AIMARKET_METIS_KEY`  | optional bearer for Metis verify\n`AIMARKET_SEARCH_URL`  | DuckDuckGo HTML endpoint override\n`AIMARKET_HUB_URL`  | AIMarket hub for `market_search` / `market_invoke` (default `https://modelmarket.dev`)\n`AIMARKET_API_KEY`  | Credit-account key from the hub's `/start` page (`https://modelmarket.dev/start`): priced `market_invoke` calls are paid from its prepaid balance; while it is short the free trial still applies. In HTTP mode it pays for every caller of that server\n`AIMARKET_SANDBOX_VISITOR`  | Trial